    "title": "Landsman Statement on Cincinnati Flooding",
    "text": "Landsman Statement on Cincinnati Flooding\nCincinnati, OH – Today, Congressman Greg Landsman (D-OH-01) released the following statement on flood damage to Cincinnati communities:\nWe’ve been working with local, state, and federal officials to ensure every available resource will be deployed to support our community.\nWorking through the disaster declaration process is a top priority, as is the work of local and federal officials to support all fixes to the Duck Creek flood gate.\nWe’re locked in to help every single resident and business recover and rebuild. Our goal is to be as reliable of a federal partner as possible.\n###",
    "summary": "Landsman Statement on Cincinnati Flooding Cincinnati, OH – Today, Congressman Greg Landsman (D-OH-01) released the following statement on flood damage to Cincinnati communities: We’ve been working with local, state, and federal officials to ensure every available resource will be deployed to support our community. Working through the disaster declaration process is a top priority, as is the work of local and federal officials to support all fixes to the Duck Creek flood gate. We’re locked in to help every single resident and business recover and rebuild. Our goal is to be as reliable of a federal partner as possible.",
